  "name": "RoY ULTIMATE Vocal - tune",
  "created": "2026-10-23T00:00:00Z",
  "app": "0.2.0",
  "description": "Everything at once, done clean: noise gate, modern fast autotune (5 ms, still natural), tight stereo double, full-range clear EQ (no telephone), two-stage compression (fast catch + smooth glue), de-esser, analog warmth, slight wide chorus, 1/8 ping-pong + short plate. Loud upfront vocal, limiter at -1 dB. Use with master preset 'RoY ULTIMATE'.",
